    <string name="screen_matches_phone">Screens in the phone\'s size</string>
    <string name="screen_display_footer">Both screens take the phone\'s shape and turn with it: aOS resizes the workspace\'s display, your Mac gets a virtual display in Open Screen Sharing\'s high performance mode, directly in the same Wi-Fi or with the Tailscale app\'s VPN. Through SSH alone your Mac keeps its own size. More resolution gives more room and less sharpness.</string>
